5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to know if our previous projects actually served their purpose. I'll check post-occupancy review ratings and survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how we manage space during construction. I will examine booking data for specialist and general rooms and timetable records on rooms out of service.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect our timelines are overly optimistic. I'll look into the decade of delivery schedules by project rationale and weather days in the site diaries.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the money we plan actually matches the cost! I'll check tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment bought earlier.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the people. I'm looking into staffing posts since the hiring freeze and bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
